### ── Mobile API (app-agentiz-mobile-api) ──────────────────────────────────────
@mobileHost = http://localhost:17280
@mobileBase = {{mobileHost}}/api/agentiz/mobile/v1

### Health
GET {{mobileBase}}/healthz

### Login: admin (UserAP) credentials -> JWT bearer token
# @name mobileLogin
POST {{mobileBase}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin",
  "password": "secret"
}

### Current user (reuses the token from the login response)
GET {{mobileBase}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}

### Projects owned by the logged-in user
GET {{mobileBase}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}

### Activity feed (newest first; page older rows with ?before=<nextBefore>)
GET {{mobileBase}}/activities?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}

### Everything actionable right now + unseen counter (the app badge)
GET {{mobileBase}}/activities/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}

### Mark the feed seen up to now
POST {{mobileBase}}/activities/seen
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Proposals needing a decision (holding=true widens to everything holding a directory)
GET {{mobileBase}}/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}

### Approve a proposal revision (edits optional)
POST {{mobileBase}}/proposals/PROPOSAL_ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": 1,
  "commitMessage": "Fix auth, reviewed"
}

### Reject a proposal revision (queues a workspace reset)
POST {{mobileBase}}/proposals/PROPOSAL_ID/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": 1
}

### Notification policy, scoped to the caller's projects
GET {{mobileBase}}/notification-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}

### Replace defaults + own project entries (foreign entries survive)
PUT {{mobileBase}}/notification-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "defaults": { "run.succeeded": { "push": "off" } },
  "projects": { "PROJECT_ID": { "mute": true } }
}
